    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innerscape</strong> places you inside a human body transformed by a rogue parasite. Miniaturized and sent on a critical mission, you are a scientist tasked with eliminating a bioweapon that has evolved beyond control.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Utilize the specialized <strong>BioStim Gun</strong>, equipped with different syringe types to interact with the organic surroundings. Open pathways with stimulator syringes and remove obstacles using dissolver syringes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles that require you to manipulate biological mechanisms to progress deeper into the body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting and Atmosphere</strong>: Explore the inner workings of a living body, where organs and tissues form a labyrinthine environment filled with dangers. Immerse yourself in a world where every sound and visual detail contributes to the sense of being inside a living organism altered by an unknown threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Navigate through twisting corridors and chambers, encountering remnants of those who came before.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innerscape</strong> places you inside a human body transformed by a rogue parasite. Miniaturized and sent on a critical mission, you are a scientist tasked with eliminating a bioweapon that has evolved beyond control.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Utilize the specialized <strong>BioStim Gun</strong>, equipped with different syringe types to interact with the organic surroundings. Open pathways with stimulator syringes and remove obstacles using dissolver syringes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Solve intricate puzzles that require you to manipulate biological mechanisms to progress deeper into the body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting and Atmosphere</strong>: Explore the inner workings of a living body, where organs and tissues form a labyrinthine environment filled with dangers. Immerse yourself in a world where every sound and visual detail contributes to the sense of being inside a living organism altered by an unknown threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Navigate through twisting corridors and chambers, encountering remnants of those who came before.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as a scientist in this short sci-fi horror adventure, tasked with eradicating a mutating parasite within a human body. Navigate eerie corridors, solve complex puzzles, and survive the lurking horrors inside.",
